      "body": "## Summary\n- Add a response-builder test proving `meta_info.image_tokens` reaches `usage.prompt_tokens_details.image_tokens` on the generic chat path.\n- Existing coverage named the equivalent behavior only in a Kimi-specific test.\n\n## Context\nMultimodal token counts are computed from `schedule_batch` offsets and should be independent of the chat encoding. This test pins the generic behavior for all vision models.\n\n## Validation\nTargeted unit test; CI will run the registered suite.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #36282923367](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36282923367)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #36282923195](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36282923195)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #36282923325](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/36282923325)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
